            "star": 4,
            "title": "CUSTOMER REVIEWS",
            "info_other": "Hiroshi T. - From Japan",
            "quote": "<p>The calming bed truly works — my Shiba Inu finally settles during thunderstorms. The design is stylish too, so it blends perfectly with our living room.</p>"
          }
        },
        "quote_t3CPMh": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/review5.png",
            "star": 5,
            "title": "CUSTOMER REVIEWS",
            "info_other": "Sofia M. - From Spain",
            "quote": "<p>The interactive toy keeps my cat busy for hours. She’s less bored and even lost some extra weight. I just wish shipping was a little faster, but overall very happy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "quote_j6rFgT": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/review4.png",
            "star": 5,
            "title": "CUSTOMER REVIEWS",
            "info_other": "Olivia P. - From United Kingdom",
            "quote": "<p>Absolutely thrilled with the grooming kit! My spaniel looks like he just came back from a professional salon. It saves me time and money, and my pup enjoys it too.</p>"
          }
